WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:03.600
- [Narrator] Budapest, Hungary,
is an architectural gem,

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.114
built from the union of three cities.

00:00:06.114 --> 00:00:08.840
And nothing symbolizes this union better

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.880
than its one of a kind parliament

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.913
built to celebrate a millennia
of Hungary's existence.

00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:17.875
(curious music)

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.040
Perched elegantly on the east
bank of the Danube river,

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.360
the Hungarian parliament
building is an example

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.330
of neo-Gothic architecture

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:30.020
with some renaissance
and baroque elements.

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.650
Commissioned in 1880,

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:35.450
it was finally completed 24 years later.

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:39.370
Its 314 feet tall and 880 feet long,

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:42.231
making it one of the
largest parliament buildings

00:00:42.231 --> 00:00:43.064
in the world.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:47.160
It's said that over a
thousand people were involved

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.800
in its construction,

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.020
during which 40 million bricks,

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.140
half a million precious stones,

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:56.480
and 88 pounds of gold were used.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:59.700
The inside is home to
Hungary's National Assembly-

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:02.770
the legislative branch of the country.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:05.950
The rest of the building's
10 courtyards and hundreds

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:09.170
of offices are linked through
a system of endless corridors

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:12.223
and a red carpet, which
is nearly two miles long.

00:01:13.415 --> 00:01:17.070
One of the highlight's
is the nation's crown,

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:19.350
worn by about 50 rulers;

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:22.433
the first of which reigned
in the 12th century.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:26.550
And like the treasures inside,
the building itself shines

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:28.963
like a jewel in this nation's skyline.

